{"id":"07b6de56db670b27","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Antichain Number Witness","display":"df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness — ZFC Order12 Antichain Number Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness — ZFC Order12 Antichain Number Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-antichain-number-witness — ZFC Order12 Antichain Number Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(A,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the antichain predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> are cardinality notions (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AntichainNumberWitness}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AntichainNumberWitness}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AntichainNumberWitness}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\approx\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12AntichainNumberWitness}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\approx\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary antichain number witness definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,\\leq_P)$ is the antichain predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":